    "name": "Feline Realms  - The Ancients' Legacy",
    "steam_appid": 3213950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Feline Realms: The Ancients' Legacy, a quirky RPG inspired by the golden era of role-playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows an ancient feline race that once traveled between worlds through portals. While they live peacefully on Felix IV, an invading force from a parallel world awakens the gate leading to Earth. Our heroes are called upon, unwillingly, to defend Earth against this new threat\u2014unaware of their ancient heritage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover your heritage as the Seshat Ankh, unlock your Guardian powers... or forge your own path\u2014I'm not judging. The fate of Earth lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and good luck with the humans... To most of them, you're just a strange cat. To others, you're royalty. The modern world presents dangers that are unique to being a cat, as you'll soon discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat relies on old-school RPG mechanics, and features three different difficulty levels, making it accessible to both young, impatient heroes and hardcore veterans who like to use their full toolkit to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is non-linear, meaning you can accomplish goals in any order you choose. You can try to beat some big bosses right away if you dare, but I recommend finding some gear first, as well as acquiring some levels. Loot is gained through questing, defeating bosses, clearing dungeons, and of course, opening chests and visiting NPC vendors.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Feline Realms: The Ancients' Legacy, a quirky RPG inspired by the golden era of role-playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows an ancient feline race that once traveled between worlds through portals. While they live peacefully on Felix IV, an invading force from a parallel world awakens the gate leading to Earth. Our heroes are called upon, unwillingly, to defend Earth against this new threat\u2014unaware of their ancient heritage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover your heritage as the Seshat Ankh, unlock your Guardian powers... or forge your own path\u2014I'm not judging. The fate of Earth lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and good luck with the humans... To most of them, you're just a strange cat. To others, you're royalty. The modern world presents dangers that are unique to being a cat, as you'll soon discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat relies on old-school RPG mechanics, and features three different difficulty levels, making it accessible to both young, impatient heroes and hardcore veterans who like to use their full toolkit to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is non-linear, meaning you can accomplish goals in any order you choose. You can try to beat some big bosses right away if you dare, but I recommend finding some gear first, as well as acquiring some levels. Loot is gained through questing, defeating bosses, clearing dungeons, and of course, opening chests and visiting NPC vendors.</p>",
    "short_description": "Feline Realms: The Ancients' Legacy is a quirky turn-based RPG where ancient feline heroes rediscover their forgotten heritage to defend Earth from an invading force. Unlock your Guardian powers, and navigate a modern world filled with danger. Can you reclaim your legacy and save Earth?",
